            <div xml:id="d557">

                <pb facs="0625" n="521" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg521"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/4593: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland (Wilson) to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-03-06T11:00:00+01:00">March 6, 1932—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 6—7:25 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>56. Your 28, March 5, 9 p.m. When I dictated my 54, March 5, 2 p.m., I made a
                    slip of the tongue in dictating the word “local”. I had no intention of
                    differentiating between the Shanghai and Nanking authorities. Please state
                    urgently whether the idea thus amended by providing consultation with Nanking
                    meets with your approval. I should like to be in possession of the information
                    if possible Monday morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
